# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Maps JS API & PlaceAutocompleteElement)
# Copy this file to .env.local and insert your key before running.
#
# Quickstart (Free, No Billing Required for Prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key and paste it below.
#    (Supports Maps JS API, Places API New, Routes API, Geocoding API, Weather API)
#
# Production Setup:
# - Create a restricted API key in Google Cloud Console and enable:
#   Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API, Elevation API, Weather API.
# - Restrict client keys by HTTP referrer and server keys by IP / API scope:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional server-only key for /api/* Route Handlers (falls back to NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY if unset)
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_google_maps_api_key_here
